{"text":"kuruntokai","n":227,"lines":["பூண்வனைந் தன்ன பொலஞ்சூட்டு நேமி","வாண்முகந் துமிப்ப வள்ளிதழ் குறைந்த","கூழை நெய்தலு முடைத்திவண்","தேரோன் போகிய கான லானே"],"tr":["pūṇvaṉain taṉṉa polañcūṭṭu nēmi","vāṇmukan tumippa vaḷḷitaḻ kuṟainta","kūḻai neytalu muṭaittivaṇ","tērōṉ pōkiya kāṉa lāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஓதஞானியார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Ōtañāṉiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 5"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பூண்வனைந்","tr":"pūṇvaṉain","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூண்","tr":"pūṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வனைந்","tr":"vaṉain"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"பொலஞ்சூட்டு","tr":"polañcūṭṭu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொலஞ்","tr":"polañ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூட்","tr":"cūṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]},{"text":"நேமி","tr":"nēmi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நே","tr":"nē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மி","tr":"mi"}]}],[{"text":"வாண்முகந்","tr":"vāṇmukan","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாண்","tr":"vāṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முகந்","tr":"mukan"}]},{"text":"துமிப்ப","tr":"tumippa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துமிப்","tr":"tumip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"வள்ளிதழ்","tr":"vaḷḷitaḻ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வள்","tr":"vaḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிதழ்","tr":"ḷitaḻ"}]},{"text":"குறைந்த","tr":"kuṟainta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குறைந்","tr":"kuṟain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]}],[{"text":"கூழை","tr":"kūḻai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழை","tr":"ḻai"}]},{"text":"நெய்தலு","tr":"neytalu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெய்","tr":"ney"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலு","tr":"talu"}]},{"text":"முடைத்திவண்","tr":"muṭaittivaṇ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முடைத்","tr":"muṭait"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திவண்","tr":"tivaṇ"}]}],[{"text":"தேரோன்","tr":"tērōṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரோன்","tr":"rōṉ"}]},{"text":"போகிய","tr":"pōkiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"கான","tr":"kāṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"லானே","tr":"lāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பூண்","parts":[{"text":"பூண்","lemma":"பூண்","gloss":"ornament"}],"gloss":"ornament"},{"surface":"வனைந்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"வனைந்து","lemma":"வனை","gloss":"having fashioned"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like fashioned"},{"surface":"பொலஞ்சூட்டு","parts":[{"text":"பொலம்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"},{"text":"சூட்டு","lemma":"சூட்டு","gloss":"rim"}],"gloss":"golden-rimmed"},{"surface":"நேமி","parts":[{"text":"நேமி","lemma":"நேமி","gloss":"wheel"}],"gloss":"chariot wheel"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாண்முகம்","parts":[{"text":"வாண்முகம்","lemma":"வாண்முகம்","gloss":"bright edge"}],"gloss":"bright edge","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துமிப்ப","parts":[{"text":"துமிப்ப","lemma":"துமி","gloss":"to cut"}],"gloss":"cutting"},{"surface":"வள்ளிதழ்","parts":[{"text":"வள்","lemma":"வள்","gloss":"thick"},{"text":"இதழ்","lemma":"இதழ்","gloss":"petal"}],"gloss":"thick petals"},{"surface":"குறைந்த","parts":[{"text":"குறைந்த","lemma":"குறை","gloss":"shortened"}],"gloss":"cut down"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கூழை","parts":[{"text":"கூழை","lemma":"கூழை","gloss":"short-stemmed"}],"gloss":"short-stemmed"},{"surface":"நெய்தலும்","parts":[{"text":"நெய்தல்","lemma":"நெய்தல்","gloss":"water lily"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"water lily also"},{"surface":"உடைத்து","parts":[{"text":"உடைத்து","lemma":"உடைத்து","gloss":"possesses"}],"gloss":"has"},{"surface":"இவண்","parts":[{"text":"இவண்","lemma":"இவண்","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேரோன்","parts":[{"text":"தேரோன்","lemma":"தேரோன்","gloss":"chariot-rider"}],"gloss":"chariot-rider","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"போகிய","parts":[{"text":"போகிய","lemma":"போ","gloss":"who went"}],"gloss":"who went"},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seaside grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"},{"surface":"ஆனே","parts":[{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"in"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed in"}]}],"literal":"Like fashioned ornaments, the golden-rimmed wheel's / bright edge cutting, thick petals shortened / short-stemmed water lilies also has here / in the seashore grove where the chariot-rider went.","translation":"In this seashore grove where the chariot-rider passed, even the short-stemmed water lilies have their thick petals cut short, severed by the bright edge of his golden-rimmed wheels that look like crafted ornaments.","modern":"ஆபரணம் போலச் செய்யப்பட்ட பொன்னாலான விளிம்பைக் கொண்ட தேர்ச் சக்கரம், தனது ஒளிரும் விளிம்பால் வெட்டியதால், தடித்த இதழ்கள் குறைந்துபோன குட்டையான நெய்தல் மலர்களையும் உடையதாக இருக்கிறது, தேரினை உடைய தலைவன் சென்றுபோன இந்த நெய்தல் நிலத்துக் கடற்கரைச் சோலை.","explanation":"The friend of the heroine speaks this poem within the hearing of the hero, who has been visiting secretly by chariot. She describes how the bright, sharp edges of his golden-rimmed chariot wheels have sliced the thick petals of the short-stemmed water lilies (neytal) in the coastal grove. This vivid image of the landscape serves as an implicit metaphor (uḷḷurai). Just as the chariot wheels repeatedly run over and damage the delicate flowers on the path, the hero's frequent, secretive visits and the resulting gossip are harming the heroine's health and reputation. By pointing out the damaged flowers, the friend subtly urges the hero to stop these transient visits and marry the heroine formally.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}